{"displayStem":"그림은 태아–태반의 큰 연결만 보인 모식도다. X·Y의 화살표는 혈류 방향이며 굵기는 산소량·유량을 뜻하지 않는다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"직접 설계한 교육용 모식도·합성 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C06 c06-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교육용 자료 모식도\"><defs><marker id=\"c06arr\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L8 3.5L0 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path></marker><pattern id=\"c06hatch\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M0 8L8 0\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path></pattern></defs><g font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"110\" width=\"140\" height=\"65\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"100\" y=\"149.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">태반</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"110\" width=\"140\" height=\"65\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"400\" y=\"149.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">태아</text><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"black\" marker-end=\"url(#c06arr)\"></line><text x=\"250\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\">X</text><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"black\" marker-end=\"url(#c06arr)\"></line><text x=\"250\" y=\"207\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Y</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"middle\">큰 연결만 보인 혈류 방향 모형</text></g></svg></div></div>"]}